<h2>Research Themes</h2>

<p class="vision-intro">

Building trustworthy human–AI decision systems
requires advances across artificial intelligence,
decision science, sustainable infrastructure and
technology governance.

Rather than isolated projects, my research forms
a coherent programme connecting these four areas.

</p>

